{
  "_readme": [
    "CurseForge 指纹（MurmurHash2）的**跨语言判据表**（ADR-052）。",
    "",
    "算法：MurmurHash2（32 位，种子 1），先把 \\t \\n \\r 空格 全部剔除再算。",
    "这份向量由 tools/gen-curseforge-fingerprint-cases.mjs 生成，",
    "而那份 JS 实现**被 CurseForge 接口自己验证过**：",
    "下载真实文件（项目 1558643 / 文件 #8600126）算指纹，",
    "POST /v1/fingerprints 能把该文件原样认回来（见 tools/probe/probe-curseforge-deep.mjs 第 ⑤ 节）。",
    "",
    "消费方：",
    "  · Rust  src-tauri/src/net/curseforge.rs 的 fingerprint_of_file（cargo test --lib net::curseforge）",
    "  · JS    本工具（--verify 模式逐条复算）",
    "两边不一致就红 —— 指纹算错的表现是\"所有 Mod 都查不到更新\"，",
    "而那是**静默**的（接口只会回一个空的 exactMatches）。"
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "空文件（剔完还是空）",
      "bytes": 0,
      "inputHex": "",
      "expectUnsigned": 1540447798,
      "expectHex": "0x5bd15e36"
    },
    {
      "name": "只有空白：空格 / \\t / \\r / \\n 全剔除后是空",
      "bytes": 5,
      "inputHex": "20090d0a20",
      "expectUnsigned": 1540447798,
      "expectHex": "0x5bd15e36"
    },
    {
      "name": "单字节 a",
      "bytes": 1,
      "inputHex": "61",
      "expectUnsigned": 626045324,
      "expectHex": "0x2550b18c"
    },
    {
      "name": "3 字节 abc（走 tail 分支）",
      "bytes": 3,
      "inputHex": "616263",
      "expectUnsigned": 1621425345,
      "expectHex": "0x60a4fcc1"
    },
    {
      "name": "4 字节 abcd（正好一个 chunk，不进 tail）",
      "bytes": 4,
      "inputHex": "61626364",
      "expectUnsigned": 3376380438,
      "expectHex": "0xc93f7a16"
    },
    {
      "name": "5 字节 abcde（一个 chunk + 1 字节 tail）",
      "bytes": 5,
      "inputHex": "6162636465",
      "expectUnsigned": 3469237630,
      "expectHex": "0xcec85d7e"
    },
    {
      "name": "11 字节 hello world",
      "bytes": 11,
      "inputHex": "68656c6c6f20776f726c64",
      "expectUnsigned": 2824650221,
      "expectHex": "0xa85cbded"
    },
    {
      "name": "a\\tb\\nc\\rd e：空白剔除后等于 abcde",
      "bytes": 9,
      "inputHex": "6109620a630d642065",
      "expectUnsigned": 3469237630,
      "expectHex": "0xcec85d7e"
    },
    {
      "name": "中文（UTF-8 多字节，逐字节算）",
      "bytes": 12,
      "inputHex": "e68891e79a84e4b896e7958c",
      "expectUnsigned": 1978760687,
      "expectHex": "0x75f17def"
    },
    {
      "name": "全部 256 个字节值（里面正好有 4 个空白字符会被剔除）",
      "bytes": 256,
      "inputHex": "",
      "expectUnsigned": 2094645347,
      "expectHex": "0x7cd9c063"
    },
    {
      "name": "1024 个 0x5A",
      "bytes": 1024,
      "inputHex": "",
      "expectUnsigned": 3856041017,
      "expectHex": "0xe5d68439"
    },
    {
      "name": "1023 个 0x00（长 tail）",
      "bytes": 1023,
      "inputHex": "",
      "expectUnsigned": 1232693370,
      "expectHex": "0x4979687a"
    }
  ]
}
